  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5fb41bbff4266946ba6cc2ccd2dff2a, type: 3}
  storyText: "Carrying the world\u2019s final hope, Leo sets out on his journey.
    Ahead of him lie dangerous lands twisted by the weakening of the World Core:
    floating valleys, ancient ruins, and places beyond logic itself.\n\nHe does not
    know what awaits him, but he knows one thing for certain\u2014if he wants to
    save Hopix, he must keep moving forward."
